    "· 麦克风未开启，不会记下你说的话": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "· Microphone off; what you say isn't recorded"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "· 麦克风未授权，打开系统设置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "· Microphone not allowed; open System Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一个模板就是若干部分，每部分有名字和一句给 AI 的要求，例如“风险：列出可能导致延期的事，附原话”。可以从现有模板复制一份再改。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A template is a list of sections, each with a name and one sentence for the AI, e.g. “Risks: list what could cause a delay, with quotes”. Start from a copy of an existing template."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一句话": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One line"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上一场完整转写": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Full transcript of last time"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上一场：%@ · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last time: %@ · %@"
