    "下一条 · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Next · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下午好": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Good afternoon"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下载": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Download"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下面是用 ScreenCaptureKit 截取整个屏幕的结果，与 Zoom / Teams / Meet 等共享整屏时的取图方式相同。如果能看到提词器，说明共享整屏时对方也可能看到；请改为只共享会议窗口或标签页。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is the whole screen captured with ScreenCaptureKit, the way Zoom, Teams or Meet capture a shared screen. If you can see the teleprompter here, others may see it when you share your entire screen; share only the meeting window or tab instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不保存会议记录": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Meeting records are not saved"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不打扰，安静地记。结束后自动整理纪要。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stays out of the way and takes notes. Notes are written when you end."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不是同一个系列": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not the same series"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不联网": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "中文版": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In Chinese"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "举例": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Example"
          }
        }
      }
    },
