      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "System recognition"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本机增强识别": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enhanced local recognition"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codex 文件代读": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codex document reading"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mac 自带 · 可直接用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Built into macOS · ready to use"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在使用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In use"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "离线、无需下载。适合普通文字；复杂表格和公式可能丢失结构，重要数字请核对。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Offline with no download. Suitable for ordinary text; complex tables and formulas may lose structure, so verify important figures."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "适合扫描件、表格和公式。需下载识别与版面模型，在本机计算、占用内存；仍可能识别出错。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suitable for scans, tables and formulas. Recognition and layout models must be downloaded and use local memory; errors are still possible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "免 OCR 模型权重，读取原文件。需要已登录的 Codex、共用组件和网络；占账号额度，速度受网络影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reads original files without OCR weights. Requires a signed-in Codex account, shared components and network access; uses account allowance."
          }
        }
      }
    },
