          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Advanced settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "展开模型参数、联网与技能、备份细项、快捷键和维护工具。关闭只隐藏选项，不修改已有配置。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show model parameters, web search, skills, backup options, shortcuts and maintenance. Turning this off only hides options."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "第一次开始会申请录屏和麦克风权限；没有权限时无法读取会议声音或屏幕。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The first session requests screen recording and microphone access. These permissions are required to read meeting audio and the screen."
          }
        }
      }
