    "展开问题": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Expand question"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "收起问题": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Collapse question"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "首页点“新会议”或“立即记录” → 会中看建议回答，或者只记录 → 结束后自动整理纪要。新手引导可以随时从这里打开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On Home, choose New Meeting or Record Now. View suggested answers or record only; notes are organized after the meeting. You can reopen the guide here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一键检查并配好回答模型、语音模型、音频来源和资料索引；哪一步没成功会直接写在这里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check and prepare the answer model, speech model, audio source and document index. Any failed step appears here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "填入人名、项目名和专有名词，识别时会更准；用逗号分隔。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter names, project names and technical terms, separated by commas, to improve recognition."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不戴耳机时对方的声音会从扬声器传进麦克风；应用比对两路音频的节奏和文字，回声不记为“我”。戴耳机始终最干净。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Without headphones, speaker audio can enter the microphone. The app compares timing and text so echoes are not attributed to you. Headphones provide the cleanest result."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "本地规则逐句判断：区分陈述、未说完、提问、请求（“说一下你对…的理解”“walk me through…”）和追问；去掉口头禅，忽略“能听到吗”这类设备确认。课程场景更严格，避免把讲师的自问自答当成提问。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Local rules distinguish statements, unfinished sentences, questions, requests and follow-ups. Filler and equipment checks are ignored. Course mode applies stricter rules to avoid treating a lecturer's rhetorical questions as requests."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "常驻 `codex app-server` 复用进程与登录，逐字流式显示；不可用时自动回退到 codex exec。exec 每次启动一个进程，等完整结果后显示。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The persistent Codex app server reuses its process and login and streams text. If unavailable, it falls back to codex exec, which starts a process for each request and shows the completed result."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先立刻给出快速回答；需要最新信息（价格、新闻、版本、现任人员、“今天 / 最近”…）时在后台联网，通常 5–20 秒后自动换成联网版，可随时切回原回答。“自动判断”用本地规则。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A quick answer appears first. For current information, search runs in the background and usually replaces it after 5–20 seconds. You can return to the original answer. Automatic selection uses local rules."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅对服务商支持的推理模型有效；不确定时保持默认。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Applies only to reasoning models supported by the provider. Keep the default if unsure."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "技能是一份 Markdown 说明（例如 SKILL.md）：你希望的说话方式、答题套路、领域知识。打开“所有系列”的技能每次回答都会用；其他技能在资料夹的“技能”页按系列勾选。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A skill is a Markdown instruction describing the desired speaking style, answer method or subject knowledge. Global skills apply to every answer; select other skills per series in the library."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "可选窗口、显示器或区域（本应用窗口除外）。系统 OCR 先给快速文字；本机增强会在后台补读复杂画面。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose a window, display or region, excluding this app. System OCR provides quick text; local enhancement can read complex images in the background."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入 PPT、Keynote 或 PDF 后，放映时会识别当前页并关联这一页的要点与提问。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After importing a PPT, Keynote or PDF, the app identifies the current slide during a presentation and links its notes and questions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按你说的话和回答里每一句的文字重合度判断。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Progress is estimated from the overlap between what you say and each sentence in the answer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整理分三步：结合资料校对转写、按模板生成带时间点的纪要，再核对原话依据和日期。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The workflow checks the transcript against materials, creates timestamped notes from the template, then checks the source wording and dates."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先扫描本机已有的兼容文档模型与支持组件，校验后复用，保留原文件。无需重复下载，也不会自动启用 OCR 或语义检索。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Scan for compatible document models and components already on this Mac. Verified files are reused in place; OCR and semantic retrieval are not enabled automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
