    "此选项仅在 NextThought 处于前台时提升工作台、设置和分离模块；切换到其他 App 后它们会降回普通层级。回答浮窗保持独立浮窗行为。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The workspace, settings and detached modules float while NextThought is active. They return to the normal level when you switch apps. The answer window remains an independent floating window."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在会议顶栏选择“提词”或“只记录”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose Teleprompter or Record Only in the meeting toolbar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "需要使用 API Key 回答引擎才能启用二次判断。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose an API Key answer engine to enable the second check."
