    "绑定本机签名（以后更新不再重新授权）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bind local signing (future updates will not require reauthorization)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS 把录屏 / 麦克风权限绑定在应用签名上。绑定后应用用本机证书重新签名，之后的自动更新沿用同一签名，权限一直有效。绑定后需要再授权一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS ties screen recording and microphone permissions to the app signature. Binding re-signs the app with a local certificate so future updates keep the same identity. You will need to grant these permissions once after binding."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "绑定本机签名并重新打开？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
