          }
        }
      }
    },
    "读取资料": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read materials"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统识别：Mac 自带、离线、无需下载；复杂表格和公式可能丢失结构。\n本机增强：另下约 1.42 GB（含共用组件），适合复杂版面；占存储与内存，仍可能识别错。\nCodex 代读：免 OCR 权重，另需约 186 MB 共用组件；联网、使用账号额度，耗时受网络影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "System recognition: built into macOS, offline, and no download required; complex tables and formulas may lose structure.\nOn-device enhancement: downloads about 1.42 GB including the shared component; handles complex layouts but uses storage and memory and may still make mistakes.\nCodex reading: no OCR model download, but needs about 186 MB of shared components; uses the network and account allowance, and speed depends on the connection."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "查找资料（向量检索可选）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Find materials (optional vector search)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不启用：按关键词查找，无需下载或建索引，准备快；同义问法可能漏检。\n启用：模型加共用组件最多约 835 MB，先在本机建索引，额外占内存；能补充按含义查找，但仍可能漏检。\n两者都只把相关片段带入回答，并非“关闭向量就发送全文”。全量发送资料会增加等待与用量，也可能超过上下文上限。共用组件只需安装一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Off: finds materials by keyword with no download or indexing, so setup is quick; equivalent phrasing may be missed.\nOn: the model and shared components use up to about 835 MB. An index is built on this Mac and uses extra memory. Meaning-based search can help but may still miss results.\nBoth options include only relevant excerpts in answers; turning off vector search does not send full documents. Sending all materials would increase wait time and usage and may exceed context limits. Shared components are installed only once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
