            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a full-screen capture through ScreenCaptureKit, similar to what Zoom, Teams, Meet, and other apps may capture when you share your screen. If the answer window is visible here, other participants may also see it during full-screen sharing. The exact capture area depends on the meeting app and sharing method."
          }
