            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open meeting notes and transcript"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“自动回答”会在识别到问题后生成参考回答；“只记录”不会自动生成，但仍可手动提问。默认模式由会议类型决定（汇报和客户沟通默认自动回答）。明确的问题通常会很快开始回答；不确定的句子会显示为可点击的“可能的问题”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Auto-answer generates a reference answer when a question is recognized. Record only does not answer automatically, but you can still ask manually. The default depends on meeting type (auto-answer is on by default for presentations and client meetings). Clear questions are usually answered quickly; uncertain sentences appear as clickable potential questions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
