    "读 4 句话，约 40 秒。只保存一串数字，不保存录音；只存在这台 Mac 上，不上传、不进备份，可随时删除。录入后，线下会议里你的发言会标为“我”。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read 4 sentences, about 40 seconds. Only a string of numbers is kept, not the recording; it stays on this Mac, is never uploaded or backed up, and can be deleted any time. After that, your lines in in-person meetings are labelled “Me”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
